<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 39 FOR ONE AT TEA VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 39 FOR ONE AT TEA VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, chasing New Zealand's first innings total of 390, were 39 for one wicket at tea on the second day of their first test match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand all out for 390 (overnight 233 for five) S.Fleming 129, C.Cairns 67; D.Cork three for 96, D.Gough four for 91). England 39 for one.</p>
</text>
